 que liga o nariz \u00e0 orelha?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A trompa de Eust\u00e1quio se estende do ouvido m\u00e9dio at\u00e9 a parte superior da garganta e se abre durante a degluti\u00e7\u00e3o ou ao bocejar para equilibrar a press\u00e3o.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5631-7282-b520-985b316e3262","description":"Trompa de Eust\u00e1quio","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5631-786f-8da3-cf3605e0d274","description":"Filtro","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5631-7921-ae41-703380c4b0e4","description":"Bulbo maxilar","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5631-7008-bcfc-93fcf7fe9af0","description":"Nervo \u00f3ptico","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5631-744e-bae0-24a78ce37913","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que a horologia estuda?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A horologia abrange o projeto, a constru\u00e7\u00e3o e o estudo de rel\u00f3gios de parede e de pulso; um horologista tamb\u00e9m pode restaurar rel\u00f3gios hist\u00f3ricos.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5631-7d42-a068-c7dfdf02fbec","description":"fabrica\u00e7\u00e3o de rel\u00f3gios, medi\u00e7\u00e3o do tempo e cronometragem","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5631-756e-8776-f38707780b3f","description":"animais","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5631-7b13-bfea-0335a55e925e","description":"doen\u00e7as ven\u00e9reas","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5631-72e5-bfa9-55efc7e71dfa","description":"fins ou causas finais","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5631-70bc-bcbf-77581215644d","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 o menor osso do corpo humano?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"O estribo \u00e9 um dos tr\u00eas ossos min\u00fasculos do ouvido m\u00e9dio, que transmitem as vibra\u00e7\u00f5es sonoras em dire\u00e7\u00e3o ao ouvido interno.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5631-7072-996d-f3d66e467374","description":"Estapedius","correct_answer":true},{"id