d de pardais \u00e9 um substantivo coletivo tradicional; \u201chost\u201d tamb\u00e9m tem um sentido mais antigo de \u201cgrande multid\u00e3o\u201d.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-711c-a3ed-87cb39759c55","description":"Um bando","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-784b-9971-a406ae09201a","description":"Uma corrida","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7ba1-ad17-837d0b896784","description":"Um campo","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7de4-84e3-3944af16de21","description":"Um feiti\u00e7o","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-70a0-964f-7ff18accc3aa","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que estuda a Kimatologia?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"O termo \u201cKimatologia\u201d deriva do grego \u201ckyma\u201d, que significa onda; essa \u00e1rea tamb\u00e9m se aplica aos movimentos do som e de outros sistemas f\u00edsicos.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-74cb-a244-e0e8eb1a4ba3","description":"ondas ou movimentos ondulat\u00f3rios","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7aa9-914e-2002ee7c0790","description":"clima","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7574-b629-8f64c920ed5e","description":"Tibete","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-75f1-aa86-9e8dfedae23c","description":"processos mentais em seres vivos","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7610-88c3-75c63766f920","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 o nome da camada externa r\u00edgida da Terra, composta pela crosta e pelo manto superior?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A litosfera \u00e9 a camada externa r\u00edgida da Terra, com cerca de 100 km de espessura, dividida em placas tect\u00f4nicas.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-797c-af93-f055dbd1fc73","description":"Litosfera","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-745b-ab6a-5106a083d35d","description":"Atmosfera","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7efd-b058-5ce2cff0bf28","descr