","description":"Um Jack","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-78f2-a159-b152f02794e7","description":"Um javali","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7dc2-a78d-d685f0547609","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que a codicologia estuda?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A codicologia estuda os livros manuscritos como objetos f\u00edsicos, incluindo seus materiais, constru\u00e7\u00e3o e produ\u00e7\u00e3o; a paleografia se concentra mais na caligrafia.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7239-a2ae-21a6cffd39d9","description":"A prepara\u00e7\u00e3o de livros e manuscritos","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-77aa-9bb3-98033ae12bed","description":"\u00c1gua","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7781-b2cb-c8ed56d577d9","description":"A natureza e as origens do conhecimento","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-75f0-97a5-aa114129c379","description":"Microrganismos","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7a22-9f90-89c3f28237e4","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Para que serve o carbonato de c\u00e1lcio, um composto qu\u00edmico frequentemente utilizado?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"O calc\u00e1rio e o m\u00e1rmore s\u00e3o ricos em carbonato de c\u00e1lcio e s\u00e3o utilizados h\u00e1 muito tempo na constru\u00e7\u00e3o civil.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7fc2-8ce8-9aecc9d2fe71","description":"\u00c9 utilizado como material de constru\u00e7\u00e3o.","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7d81-8483-b9b3457c63d2","description":"\u00c9 utilizado para conservar alimentos.","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-724e-9406-f4dfe2ca118d","description":"\u00c9 usado na fabrica\u00e7\u00e3o de placas de gesso.","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7608-8b55-55e5ef931ee2","description":"\u00c9 usado em detergentes para roupas.","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7839-9520-926d7ee91ae1","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual osso N\u00c3O faz parte do cr\u00e2nio humano?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Os ossos do carpo formam o punho; os ossos occipital e temporal fazem parte do cr\u00e2nio, enquanto a maxila forma a mand\u00edbula superior.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7652-8824-529eb1dbc9e7","description":"Carpal","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7f9a-b137-4e236ce1d750","description":"Occipital","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-78d6-922c-0bad57209423","description":"Temporal","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7a11-bd98-dda5aad930b6","description":"Maxila","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-734f-a0c1-a339c18be887","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual elemento est\u00e1 faltando na alimenta\u00e7\u00e3o quando ocorre o b\u00f3cio?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"O iodo \u00e9 necess\u00e1rio para a produ\u00e7\u00e3o dos horm\u00f4nios da tireoide; uma defici\u00eancia pode causar o aumento do volume da gl\u00e2ndula tireoide, formando um b\u00f3cio.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-706f-8d45-d07d62c716a5","description":"Iodo","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7c9e-a640-0659e60ced85","description":"Pot\u00e1ssio","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7eb7-b650-bba0ec2f7a72","description":"Cloro","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7382-9f40-a4300b40e3a1","description":"Ferro","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-745c-a7fe-4425ab839d48","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual prote\u00edna \u00e9 respons\u00e1vel pelo transporte de oxig\u00eanio no sangue?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A hemoglobina cont\u00e9m grupos heme que cont\u00eam ferro e se ligam ao oxig\u00eanio de forma revers\u00edvel, conferindo aos gl\u00f3bulos vermelhos sua cor.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-75d7-8d62-3a9500f02d06","description":"Hemoglobina","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7669-bb33-3f2559d66298","description":"Histona","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-70da-9479-90827ab3b2a3","description":"Histidina","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7048-a164-cd3908abf97c","description":"GABA","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7654-9c57-c3f2db64943f","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a palavra para designar um grupo de patos-reais?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"\u201cSord\u201d \u00e9 um substantivo coletivo tradicional para patos-reais. Os patos-reais tamb\u00e9m s\u00e3o os ancestrais selvagens da maioria das ra\u00e7as de patos dom\u00e9sticos.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7558-b7ba-e5880686a919","description":"Um \u201csord\u201d","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-72d6-8a20-20ccd98e029d","description":"Um \u201cparlamento\u201d","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-786d-9840-7b657f385748","description":"Um \u201cpaddling\u201d","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-772d-945a-25af041a84e6","description":"Um \u201cskulk\u201d","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-751c-a903-86344f71e5f5","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que estuda a ortopterologia?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A ortopterologia trata dos insetos da ordem Orthoptera; o nome tem origem em ra\u00edzes gregas que significam \u201casa reta\u201d, em refer\u00eancia \u00e0s suas asas anteriores.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-76eb-8517-35f3f0c1b79f","description":"gafanhotos e grilos","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-726b-856e-6c3ebceda1b0","description":"o estudo e o tratamento de doen\u00e7as do trato urogenital","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7339-911f-4c1fffafac4d","description":"a biosfera e suas rela\u00e7\u00f5es com a litosfera e a atmosfera","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7a56-9458-92371ab842da","description":"sa\u00f