 para demonstrar que um microrganismo espec\u00edfico causa uma determinada doen\u00e7a.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-73ef-ae20-b9be369479f9","description":"Robert Koch","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7e13-b26f-de8ee0ae4977","description":"Louis Pasteur","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7009-a652-9d3249a7e7dc","description":"Joseph Lister","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7f6d-8d74-37bce2fb1aa7","description":"Paul Ehrlich","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7f8f-a76f-b83bc9f2873d","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 o nome coletivo para um grupo de rouxin\u00f3is?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"\u201cA watch\u201d \u00e9 o nome coletivo tradicional para os rouxin\u00f3is, um dos muitos nomes engra\u00e7ados que a l\u00edngua inglesa d\u00e1 a grupos de p\u00e1ssaros.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7db8-adab-52f72a5fd363","description":"A watch","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7534-adce-974cedcb5473","description":"Um encanto","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-71c4-acbc-2344baa4c135","description":"Um trapo","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-75ab-a0a8-26d84400334e","description":"Uma exalta\u00e7\u00e3o","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7824-add5-5fa023c9d190","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a palavra para designar um grupo de gado?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Um \u201cdrove\u201d \u00e9 um grupo de animais sendo conduzidos juntos; um \u201cgaggle\u201d \u00e9 um bando de gansos, um \u201cpride\u201d \u00e9 uma alcateia de le\u00f5es e um \u201cpod\u201d \u00e9 um grupo de mam\u00edferos marinhos.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-719c-9593-0efc5a37aeab","description":"Um rebanho","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7a28-89fe-5afc9367276d","description":"Um cardume","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7be8-9454-3e6d0d9ca33a","description":"Um bando","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-740d-b358-3fb3d6064b44","description":"Um pride","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-70c5-81b5-65d67822131d","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como se chama um jacar\u00e9 macho?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Um \u201cbull\u201d \u00e9 um jacar\u00e9 macho; os machos adultos costumam ser maiores do que as f\u00eameas.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-77e2-a9db-d4ec4a33ed73","description":"Um \u201cbull\u201d","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7a9c-8212-d8661ca8e6d5","description":"Um \u201ccock\u201d","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7405-9104-45cb99610747","description":"Um \u201ctom\u201d","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7ca1-884d-0dc13538fe4a","description":"Um \u201cbuck\u201d","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7220-bfe5-5916eb9cd941","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a temperatura corporal m\u00e9dia dos seres humanos?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"37 \u00b0C (98,6 \u00b0F) \u00e9 o valor de refer\u00eancia tradicional, embora as leituras consideradas saud\u00e1veis variem de acordo com a pessoa, a hora do dia e o m\u00e9todo de medi\u00e7\u00e3o.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7924-92ce-ad8a5d9740c9","description":"37 \u00b0C","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-77b9-8183-54048491fb5c","description":"35 \u00b0C","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7674-951b-ede91375e1af","description":"33 \u00b0C","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-701c-a5ef-ba2d6cd629f2","description":"39 \u00b0C","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7508-9f3a-16b31422f43a","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 outro termo para carboidrato?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Os sacar\u00eddeos s\u00e3o a\u00e7\u00facares e carboidratos relacionados; a glicose e a frutose s\u00e3o a\u00e7\u00facares simples espec\u00edficos, enquanto os lip\u00eddios pertencem a uma classe diferente de nutrientes.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-73af-bae7-b6d23ade6f63","description":"Sac\u00e1rido","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7af4-85d9-9b4ac8ec323e","description":"Glicose","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7c5a-861f-136cbf183fd5","description":"Frutose","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7dfb-aca7-a2841661709a","description":"Lip\u00eddeo","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-72db-8e39-e1f544ad13c6","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual subst\u00e2ncia tem a f\u00f3rmula qu\u00edmica H\u2083PO\u2084?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"O \u00e1cido fosf\u00f3rico \u00e9 usado como acidulante em muitas bebidas do tipo cola e tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 importante na fabrica\u00e7\u00e3o de fertilizantes fosfatados.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7401-a2f3-e48bc7f52b2c","description":"\u00c1cido fosf\u00f3rico","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7b67-8d65-51796505f27e","description":"Nitrato de pot\u00e1ssio","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-773a-a243-343bd333beb2","description":"Am\u00f4nia","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-71e8-ae7f-69eccb61b8c9","description":"Amianto","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-71a5-96c6-a0e177703dbe","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que estuda a posologia?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A posologia \u00e9 um ramo da farmacologia; as decis\u00f5es sobre a dosagem podem variar de acordo com a idade, o tamanho corporal e o estado de sa\u00fade do paciente.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7718-98c9-70b1ccf525a8","description":"dosagem de medicamentos","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-79da-8457-0f00c87995c4","description":"origem da vida","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7d5c-95d6-4b94684f60e6","description":"doen\