an\u00e7o not\u00e1vel em rela\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0s telas monocrom\u00e1ticas de muitos dos primeiros jogos de fliperama.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7ab4-9952-3dd0df94b4f9","description":"Atari","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-77b3-a0ea-e9229d0a8744","description":"Sega","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7860-8cdb-61182b366bc1","description":"Nintendo","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7192-b10e-8a4825d68799","description":"Sony","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-78d6-9b57-0c4f249f1397","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Em que per\u00edodo o diplodoco viveu?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"O diplodoco viveu durante o Jur\u00e1ssico Superior, e seus f\u00f3sseis s\u00e3o encontrados na Forma\u00e7\u00e3o Morrison, no oeste da Am\u00e9rica do Norte.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-73d0-8090-8217a934c9b0","description":"Jur\u00e1ssico","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-78f5-8646-ccb8721abdaa","description":"Tri\u00e1ssico","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-76a7-9878-23db789f0f52","description":"Cret\u00e1ceo","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7195-ba8a-85b0c295a544","description":"Devoniano","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-77fd-996f-17af1685ad9a","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a idade aproximada do universo?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A estimativa de 13,8 bilh\u00f5es de anos se baseia em medi\u00e7\u00f5es da expans\u00e3o c\u00f3smica e do fundo c\u00f3smico de micro-ondas, o resplendor remanescente do Big Bang.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-733e-9e7c-f278d2ef488f","description":"13,8 bilh\u00f5es de anos","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-79ea-b2c3-a1aca93cffe2","description":"13,8 quatrilh\u00f5es de anos","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7da3-b1e6-6bb18a6a2853","description":"13,8 milh\u00f5es de anos","correct_answer":fa