","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7f66-b8ed-b15152ce30cc","description":"Supermarine","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-76bf-933e-0604dc332fa2","description":"Boeing","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-76d8-94ba-86d8977d7645","description":"Avro","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7291-b4f0-3c2eca44b3f4","description":"De Havilland","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-771e-945d-c48494590067","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a palavra para designar um grupo de javalis?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"\u201cSounder\u201d \u00e9 um substantivo coletivo para porcos selvagens. \u201cPride\u201d geralmente se refere a le\u00f5es, enquanto \u201cshoal\u201d \u00e9 um grupo de peixes.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7b32-8c42-494337a45598","description":"Um \u201csounder\u201d","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-75f5-a7a7-20fe039aa6b8","description":"Um \u201cshoal\u201d","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7c68-bbb4-884452af2559","description":"Um \u201cpride\u201d","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7c91-90f8-f125bd79be0c","description":"Um \u201csedge\u201d","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-79c5-99d6-91587f28970e","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que a selenologia estuda?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A selenologia estuda a superf\u00edcie, a composi\u00e7\u00e3o e a hist\u00f3ria geol\u00f3gica da Lua. O nome vem de Selene, a personifica\u00e7\u00e3o grega da Lua.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-791b-9baa-be50de8d3b0d","description":"A Lua","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7907-ad00-ab8548e018c8","description":"Imposto","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7353-9b9a-cdfc49091cbe","description":"Calor","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7a1f-9a7a-feb4dc2891bf","description":"Intera\u00e7\u00f5es entre irm\u00e3os","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7f10-9aff-f1e034b58f8c","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que a tricologia estuda?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A tricologia se concentra na sa\u00fade do cabelo e do couro cabeludo, incluindo quest\u00f5es como queda de cabelo e caspa.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7517-a05d-6155f07fee02","description":"cabelo e couro cabeludo","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7df5-b247-3dfae3bb0688","description":"anjos","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7d1b-b54d-0b4a7de4ff43","description":"a ecologia das comunidades vegetais","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7181-bc02-c37369d6823c","description":"sono","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7c90-a278-5f8cd394d321","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual f\u00edsico franc\u00eas descobriu a radioatividade enquanto estudava sais de ur\u00e2nio?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Henri Becquerel descobriu que os compostos de ur\u00e2nio emitiam espontaneamente radia\u00e7\u00e3o penetrante. Ele dividiu o Pr\u00eamio Nobel de F\u00edsica de 1903 com Marie e Pierre Curie.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-77a1-b9dc-c08def79d594","description":"Henri Becquerel","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7af7-8ac8-0b60fa924081","description":"Marie Curie","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7e25-b748-69c4593fb59a","description":"Pierre Curie","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7285-b3b6-401733cdfff1","description":"Ernest Rutherford","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7d4b-9377-84a0d8e5e044","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O \u00e1cido asc\u00f3rbico \u00e9 comumente conhecido como qual vitamina?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A vitamina C \u00e9 necess\u00e1ria para a produ\u00e7\u00e3o de col\u00e1geno, e os seres humanos precisam obt\u00ea-la dos alimentos, pois n\u00e3o conseguem produzi-la por conta pr\u00f3pria.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7fe6-8ad8-1640a8afbfbe","description":"Vitamina C","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-70e6-849d-b47d2c19b270","description":"Vitamina D","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7f2e-9712-b8fbf2d30de4","description":"Vitamina A","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7163-a90b-7024f410a163","description":"Vitamina B","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7d92-96b0-5c9cf6a4b9d4","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 o s\u00edmbolo qu\u00edmico do cobre?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Cu vem de \u201ccuprum\u201d, o nome latino para cobre.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-77a5-b999-e04339b9f33e","description":"Cu","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-74e0-84f3-e45c4965f8b2","description":"Co","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7fa8-8b08-d2565907e1cf","description":"C","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7d60-875e-029d3a77b194","description":"K","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-782b-92ef-2b8cccd4e774","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Em quantos graus a Terra gira a cada hora?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Uma volta completa equivale a 360 graus; dividindo esse valor por 24 horas, obt\u00e9m-se 15 graus por hora.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7882-9554-3b2087dc5b9e","description":"15","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7013-b322-446ec0b7ca58","description":"10","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7aba-bb81-99bd6b766d23","description":"24","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7fe1-92c7-fd6eee5a1dce","description":"30","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-72f6-af00-a819d9c966cc","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Para que serve o tricloro-metano, um composto qu\u00edmico frequentemente utilizado?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"O triclorometano, mais conhecido como clorof\u00f3rmio, dissolve muitos compostos org\u00e2nicos, por isso \u00e9 utilizado como solvente para vernizes, produtos para polir pisos e resinas.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7b05-8daa-52d769af0ffa","description":"\u00c9 utilizado como solvente para vernizes, produtos para polir pisos e resinas.","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-78dc-acd0-bab06a8bf2fc","description":"\u00c9 utilizado para limpeza de superf\u00edcies, branqueamento, remo\u00e7\u00e3o de odores e desinfec\u00e7\u00e3o da \u00e1gua.","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7a0d-8386-f2da4ee3a2b0","description":"\u00c9 utilizado na fabrica\u00e7\u00e3o de celulose e papel, alumina, sab\u00e3o e detergentes.","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-741b-9ad7-ea2c5c9271e3","description":"\u00c9 utilizado como oscilador em r\u00e1dios e rel\u00f3gios.","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7c7d-bfac-a771b8aea3a0","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que a histopatologia estuda?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A histopatologia examina amostras de bi\u00f3psia ao microsc\u00f3pio e \u00e9 comumente utilizada para diagnosticar c\u00e2ncer e outras doen\u00e7as a partir de altera\u00e7\u00f5es celulares.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7d44-b028-ee29f5909e13","description":"a estrutura dos tecidos doentes","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7863-8d61-ae54b01d215f","description":"a biosfera e suas rela\u00e7\u00f5es com a litosfera e a atmosfera","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7649-a763-76374b8de069","description":"o f\u00edgado; um ramo da medicina","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7ed8-9d2c-808579b1c73e","description":"estudo dos cavalos","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7713-8563-269517595061","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a palavra para designar um grupo de fais\u00f5es?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"\u201c