en\u00e7as","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7eae-931c-a27cff9de3d6","description":"Cosm\u00e9ticos","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-73e7-8a7e-74d493bd3a04","description":"Esquemas","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-790c-8ee2-54723cc919b9","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que \u00e9 usado para armazenar carga e energia em um campo el\u00e9trico?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Um capacitor armazena energia em um campo el\u00e9trico entre condutores; um indutor armazena energia em um campo magn\u00e9tico, enquanto os resistores dissipam energia.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7c27-9b3a-f34b5136163a","description":"Capacitor","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7510-8a75-0f59a29523a6","description":"Indutor","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7cb8-a353-2c875eb31e7b","description":"Transistor","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7859-91c4-e26fd2cb5f5e","description":"Resistor","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-72b3-9b91-29ba37632a61","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"De que parte do corpo faz parte a esclera?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A esclera do globo ocular \u00e9 sua camada externa resistente e branca, que ajuda a proteger as estruturas internas e a manter sua forma.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7d7e-8c9a-525f6c1bbed2","description":"O globo ocular","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7b7a-a1e0-97eaec0118df","description":"A orelha","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7c38-b5e9-65e92a515c2f","description":"O c\u00e9rebro","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-7553-9512-9b055cae6db0","description":"O esqueleto","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5632-729d-b035-f112e5e106c4","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a palavra para designar um grupo de raposas?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Um \u201cskul