ologia estuda?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"O termo \u201csomatologia\u201d deriva do grego \u201csoma\u201d, que significa \u201ccorpo\u201d; essa \u00e1rea de estudo analisa a forma corporal e as caracter\u00edsticas f\u00edsicas.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5633-7136-b902-7aababf05e66","description":"estudo das caracter\u00edsticas humanas","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5633-7982-b6e9-8ee687681af4","description":"os olhos","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5633-794d-b3f6-d9e270a9646b","description":"madeira","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5633-73ed-b702-015c59f0731f","description":"o estudo e a psicologia dos organismos no que diz respeito \u00e0s suas fun\u00e7\u00f5es e estruturas","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5633-7612-82df-bcd8b8e5def9","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual inven\u00e7\u00e3o, patenteada em 1891 pelo agente funer\u00e1rio americano Almon Strowger, eliminou a necessidade de operadores humanos para conectar as chamadas?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A central telef\u00f4nica autom\u00e1tica encaminhava as chamadas por meio de comuta\u00e7\u00e3o eletromec\u00e2nica; O primeiro sistema comercial de Strowger come\u00e7ou a operar em La Porte, Indiana, em 1892.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-5633-78da-ae1f-bec9aa821f19","description":"A central telef\u00f4nica autom\u00e1tica","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-5633-7bf7-829a-9683a25a2df5","description":"O aparelho auditivo","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5633-74ab-b750-d2ab3e12e59e","description":"O tel\u00e9grafo","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-5633-7053-a3e3-e684628a6d9e","description":"O microfone","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-5633-74f3-a5ef-61c21c55d937","locale":"ptBR","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a propriedade caracter\u00edstica dos bons condutores el\u00e9tricos?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"A baixa resist\u00eancia p